  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "_comment": "Triggered on a store-change event (carries tenant_id). NUMU-api enforces tenant isolation (RLS) server-side; the workflow never sees another tenant's data. A merchant's reindex never touches another tenant (SC-005)."
